      <p>No. 117, 2019</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Farm Household Support Act 2014</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 11 December 2019</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
